674	
675	  Add `expectBookingRulesHold(pool: Pool): Promise<void>` to `src/server/test-db.ts`. Task 8 reuses it. It asserts three things:
676	  - no active duplicate `(mentor_id, starts_at)`: `group by … having count(*) > 1` returns no rows;
677	  - no `(mentor_id, mentor_local_date)` with more than 2 active bookings;
678	  - every booking passes `worksAt(mentor, starts_at)`, and its `mentor_local_date` equals `localDate(starts_at, mentor.timeZone)`. Mentors come from `loadMentors`.
679	
680	- [ ] **Step 2: Run them and see them fail**
681	
682	Run: `npx vitest run src/server/bookings.test.ts`
683	Expected: FAIL, failing to resolve `./bookings.ts`.
684	
685	- [ ] **Step 3: Implement `src/server/bookings.ts`**
686	  - **`bookSlot`** follows spec §6 exactly:
687	    1. If `!isBookableTime(startsAt, now)`, return `SLOT_UNAVAILABLE`.
688	    2. Candidates are `loadMentors` filtered by `worksAt`. Sort them by active count on `localDate(startsAt, mentor.timeZone)`, then by id. Get the counts with one `group by mentor_id, mentor_local_date` query.
689	    3. For each candidate, check out one client and run `BEGIN` (default READ COMMITTED):
690	       1. `SELECT id FROM mentors WHERE id = $1 FOR UPDATE`.
691	       2. Look for an active booking at `(mentor_id, starts_at)`. If one exists, `ROLLBACK` and try the next candidate.
692	       3. Count active bookings on `(mentor_id, mentor_local_date)`. If the count is at least `DAILY_CAP`, `ROLLBACK` and try the next candidate.
693	       4. `await hooks?.beforeInsert?.()`.
694	       5. `INSERT … RETURNING *`, then `COMMIT`.
695	       6. On error code `23505`, `ROLLBACK` and try the next candidate. Re-throw any other error after `ROLLBACK`.
696	       7. Release the client in `finally`.
697	    4. If no candidate succeeded, return `SLOT_UNAVAILABLE`.
698	  - It never sends email. Comment the `FOR UPDATE` line: `// the turnstile: bookings for one mentor take turns (spec §6); relies on read committed`.
699	  - **Mapping and loading:**
700	    - `loadMentors` trims `time` values to `'HH:MM'`.
701	    - Rows map to camelCase.
702	    - `newClassLink` is `https://classroom.example/trial/${randomUUID()}`.
703	
704	- [ ] **Step 4: Run the tests and see them pass in both host zones**
705	
706	Run: `npm test`
707	Expected: PASS twice.
